cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use course2video, please cite it as below."
title: "course2video: self-hostable pipeline from course documents to lecturer-approved slides and narrated videos"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Seneca Innovation Center"
repository-code: "https://github.com/seneca-innovation-center/course2video"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
keywords:
  - open educational resources
  - higher education
  - lecture video
  - self-hosted LLM
  - document understanding
  - text-to-speech
abstract: >-
  A self-hostable, open-source pipeline that turns a course package (lecture notes,
  exercises and solutions) into validated slides, a lecturer review step, lecture-style
  narration and a narrated video with subtitles, designed to run with an open-weight model
  served on premises.
